{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-16_beg","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-15","title":"示我以真","storyCode":"16-16","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-16_beg.txt","sourceHash":"d7d63be1ed32872213265af189486eb4a9d0d3e714eb9b49b2cfd3e953da47c8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"雷爾金帶人成功佔領了崗哨，卻在點燃勝利的火把後，面對烏薩斯集團軍的降臨。村莊中，在Mantra的幫助下，別喬克找回記憶，揭露了聖愚的真容。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g11_abandonedsentry"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮躁的士兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（打哈欠）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的士兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打起精神來，還有兩個小時才換班。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮躁的士兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*烏薩斯粗口*……在這種冰天雪地，連一隻裂獸都沒有。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的士兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等……你有聽到什麼聲音嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮躁的士兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"士兵轉過頭，剛想說些什麼，一支弩箭便射穿了同伴的腦袋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮躁的士兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮躁的士兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1976_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金！下面的已經全部解決了！我們現在就衝上去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！不要冒然行動！回來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"礦工們聚集在哨所的腳下，死死地盯著頭頂來回閃爍的警報燈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心頭頂的攻擊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工A&礦工B (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們被發現了！他們要撤掉梯子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只能從正面突破了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第三隊，帶著所有炸藥跟著我。我們唯一的目標就是突破哨所的大門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我倒下了，不要停留，接替我衝上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四隊、五隊，繼續發射弩箭，做好掩護！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其餘人維持包圍網，不要放走任何一個士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工C&礦工D (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽我口令——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"探照燈的光線捕捉到了眾人的行跡，緊接著便是一陣驟雨般的射擊。\n雷爾金不斷地移動向前，盡可能靠近哨所，他舉起弩，瞄準了眾人頭頂的那一盞致命的探照燈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"突然，雷爾金感覺自己的額頭傳來一陣刺痛，他的左眼被一抹紅色覆蓋。\n鮮血從他的額頭緩緩流下，使他的腦內嗡嗡作響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂慮的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金？雷爾金！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅定的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不能撤退！剩下的人跟我一起繼續往前！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，反正前後都是死路，死前也要拉幾個一起死！"},{"type":"narration","text":"身旁人的呼喊若即若離，他聽到弩箭射入血肉的聲音，他聽到周圍不斷有人倒下。\n不可以倒下，不可以在離勝利如此之近的地方倒下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g11_abandonedsentry"},{"type":"narration","text":"他用盡最後一點力氣向自己的四肢發出指令，他再次舉起了弩，對準上方那一點刺眼的光源，扣動了扳機。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的火力變弱了！快跟上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是現在，預備——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅定的礦工 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"門被炸開了——大家跟我一起衝！"},{"type":"narration","text":"礦工們的聲音越來越遙遠，雷爾金必須努力跟上他們的步伐。\n而在生死互搏的戰鬥中，沒有人會注意到他的異樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他扶著被炸得支離破碎的斷壁殘垣，一步步朝高處走去。\n意識正緩緩恢復，身體似乎也慢慢適應了疼痛。\n他跨過了無數上一秒還鮮活的軀體。螺旋上升的階梯一直延伸到最高處的出口，那小小的洞口圈住了烏薩斯極夜最美的一簇極光。\n恍惚間，他想到了礦井，他坐著電梯一路向上的時候，也是這樣仰望著頭頂唯一的光亮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"邁過最後一級階梯，他站在了極光之中，他站在了群星之下，他回到了同伴之間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金，你還好嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒事，我沒事。"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷爾金抹去了額頭上滲出的鮮血，環顧四周的同伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人少了一半……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅定的礦工 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……但我們成功了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們成功了……"},{"type":"narration","text":"極目遠望，聖駿堡的方向依然被一片層疊的針葉林遮住，巨大的冰面似乎在嘲弄他們所掀起的抗爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們從陰暗的礦洞裡爬到了地面上，現在我們又站到了集團軍的崗哨上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們接下來會越過冰湖、穿過樹林，將旗幟插在更多地方。"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷爾金目光如炬，他想將自己的信念傳遞給每一個人。\n所有人的臉上也都洋溢著勝利的喜悅，他們等待這天已經太久太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於，尼克托——"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷爾金下意識側過身，卻沒有在身旁看到那個熟悉的身影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……尼克托？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g8_farnorthtundra_aurora"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼……呼……"},{"type":"narration","text":"在第一根弩箭發射出去的時候，我就逃走了。\n害怕不是什麼可恥的事，只有最蠢的蠢人才不知道害怕。\n雷爾金是個瘋子，跟隨他的人也是。\n我本來想拉他們一把的，如果他們執意要去送死，那就去吧。\n可是我還不能死。\n從皮匠到教書匠，再到伯爵的養子，我做了那麼多事，不是為了輕飄飄地把命葬送在那種地方的。\n死了，就什麼都沒了。\n我總得想辦法活下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面，前面就是沃爾格勒……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……從頭再來吧，尼克托。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*烏薩斯粗口*……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是……那是什麼東西啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g11_abandonedsentry"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅定的礦工 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，火把！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅定的礦工 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們應該點燃火把，讓其他人知道我們已經成功了！讓他們過來會合！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對……沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把火生起來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"遠處傳來沉悶的低音，響徹整個冰原，震顫著每個人的耳膜和心臟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼動靜？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅定的礦工 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你們看遠處……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i14"},{"type":"narration","text":"眾人朝那個礦工所指的方向看去，龐大的高速戰艦正從地平線緩緩升起，大到幾乎讓人難以分辨那究竟是艦艇還是巨型移動城市。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i14"},{"type":"narration","text":"方才的那片針葉林如風捲殘雲般被抹平，星辰也被一片紅色的光芒掩蓋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i14"},{"type":"narration","text":"雪和樹木的軀幹一齊被捲入空中，它們在此刻沒有任何區別，全被撕碎、揚起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i12"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i12"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i12"},{"type":"narration","text":"直到此刻……\n人們才知道他們面對的是什麼。\n烏薩斯。\n這就是烏薩斯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g11_abandonedsentry"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"原來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，竟然是這樣……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g15_ursusvillage_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛收到了一條公共廣播的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廣播說，烏薩斯的礦脈正在全面枯竭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"集團軍準備完全封鎖這個消息，目前至少有一支軍隊已經來到遠北地區……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這則消息是博士他們傳來的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不確定，但是很有可能。這是博士發送給我們的提醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礦脈枯竭，難道是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我不明白，烏薩斯想要徹底封鎖這則消息？難道他們準備將遠北地區所有知道這件事的人都滅口嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……果然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礦脈枯竭的傳聞是真的……原來遠北地區一直以來發生的種種異常都是有跡可循的，這才是他們一直想要隱瞞的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像事先就預料到了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到剛才都還只是一個最悲觀的猜想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如今我有理由相信這個消息是真的，我更不會懷疑集團軍中的一部分人能做出這種事來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在整片大地上都不會有比遠北地區更危險的地方了，我們必須馬上離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我們還沒有和博士他們取得聯絡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們收到了來自他們的提醒，說明至少在情報上，他們處在比我們更主動的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何況我們現在回去甚至不一定能找到他們，只會浪費時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，Mon3tr可以保護博士的安全，比起大部隊，他們反而不容易成為目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，阿洛伊澤“中士”，如果集團軍是代表烏薩斯來封鎖這則消息，我們又該如何相信你說的聖駿堡是一個安全的去處？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們還是不信任我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我們的確需要確保……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“凱爾希”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在不久前，烏薩斯再次注意到了這個名字。這位神秘的女士在烏薩斯——乃至整片大地留下的痕跡，都太過離奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與她有關的消息對烏薩斯而言已經接近最高機密，也正因為如此，有人期待她能夠解答烏薩斯如今面臨的一些問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底是誰……是什麼身分？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重新自我介紹一下吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿洛伊澤·瓦西里耶夫娜·戈爾奇科娃，烏薩斯近衛軍皇家直屬營中尉。我的上級之一……是維特議長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這次來到遠北地區有兩個任務——調查中心礦區的變異感染者及相關異常事件，以及……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……與羅德島取得聯絡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，這是一次遲到的坦誠，我也的確想過將這個秘密保留到最後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管你們現在是否相信，如果我有任何敵意，早在布列斯克城內，各位就已經身陷囹圄了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島並不歡迎這樣的合作方式，但我同樣可以理解您的立場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們先停止爭議吧……阿洛伊澤小姐，請問您準備的撤離方案是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涅瓦湖西南岸，離這裡大約十公里的地方，有我事先準備好的車輛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準備得不算充裕，但應該足以接走這裡的所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以先將所有人暗中安置在聖駿堡城外的村落，再另找機會，讓各位在聖駿堡的庇護下入城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra女士說，這裡的人都還處在聖愚的影響下，我們需要先讓他們擺脫聖愚的控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……她能發現聖愚，卻沒有解決辦法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭小姐，我絕對不願意坐視悲劇發生，但更不會忘記自己的使命。我必須確保，我們當中有人可以活著將消息帶回聖駿堡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們執意要保護這裡的所有人並且一起離開……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿洛伊澤","speakerId":"avg_npc_1966_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最多等你們一個小時。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"瞭解，我會把握時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想我已經找到了突破口。"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mantra仔細地將自己的感知投射到這裡的每一個角落。\n在幾乎所有思緒都陷入麻木、毫無波動時，她抓住了一絲微小的不同。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……奶奶……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們……走吧？離開，這裡，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您，起身，所有人都會……和您，一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們去，南方，去聖駿堡，或者去……任何地方，只是不在……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好不好？"},{"type":"narration","text":"別喬克單膝跪地，跪在被她認作奶奶的虛影身前。她握住在Mantra眼中並不存在的雙手，然後將臉頰緊緊地貼了上去。\n直到看見女孩臉上流下的一行淚水，Mantra才驚覺這信任如此令人戰慄，即使沒有任何回應，女孩仍繼續這樣做著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mantra回想起剛才Raidian的話。\n“別喬克的父母因為組織罷工而被判處死刑，奶奶是她如今唯一的親人。”\n“似乎在礦區裡，所有人都認識娜迦，甚至就連衛兵也不例外。”\n“他們會向她尋求幫助，甚至比求助流動醫療隊更加頻繁。病痛時尋求寬慰，心傷時尋求開解，最後都在她的話語中獲得奇異的平靜。”\n“……我早該意識到有問題，我竟然以為她只是一位頗有名望的老人。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶，拜託您……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mantra注視著眼前的女孩，讓自己的聲音緩緩出現在她的腦海中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"她認為，你們能在這裡獲得平靜。\n在所有的希望都破滅以後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰——"},{"type":"narration","text":"別喬克。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"別喬克轉頭，只看見站在自己身後的斐迪亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您、您知道，我的名字？但我沒有……告訴過您……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少在這裡，你的表達應該是清晰的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你的話語一如平常，說明受到的影響並不深刻……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許你還有清醒的可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜迦是你的親人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，她是……我的奶奶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也是我，唯一的，親人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她是，我的奶奶，我當然，確定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你的奶奶會要求所有人忍耐痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓他們既不想活下去，也不會主動結束痛苦，選擇死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不、不會——奶奶沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她只是，累了。就像大家……大家都只是，累了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們想活著，我們當然想！但總有人，不讓我們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"總有人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"糾、糾察隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們擊退了糾察隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那也還有，衛兵和……研究所裡的，那些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們也不在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有誰不讓你們活著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"黑漆漆的……怪物……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有……還有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪？我想不起……我想不起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我重新再問你一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":"avg_4204_mantra_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被你握著手的那個人，是你的親人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"回頭看看吧，別喬克。"},{"type":"narration","text":"別喬克不想回頭。只要不回頭，被自己緊握的那雙冰冷而乾枯的手，就會永遠維持著記憶中的模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，你看到了什麼？"},{"type":"narration","text":"不能回頭。不能回頭。不能回頭。\n她這樣告訴自己。\n最終，她還是回過頭去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"奶奶就在她的面前。唱著搖籃曲的奶奶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看到……娜迦奶奶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，你仔細看。"},{"type":"narration","text":"奶奶在她的面前。雙手冰冷的奶奶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我……我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在，你看到什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看到……圓，還看到——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g4_miningarea_polluted"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i01"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i08_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——紅色。"},{"type":"narration","text":"別喬克不斷搖頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"總是紅色？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i08_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"坐著的奶奶，站立的奶奶，身上變換著詭異色彩的奶奶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"決定了自己能夠死去的、倒在血泊中的奶奶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g3_miningarea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑剔的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，烏薩斯的鬼天氣真是冷得要命！這樣哪裡像是秋天……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑剔的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"露天的宴會，既沒有草坪，也沒有野餐桌？您說，您邀請我們來這裡，究竟能欣賞些什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殷勤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"欣賞在卡西米爾花錢也買不到的娛樂項目，等著瞧吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑剔的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，無非是拿生死來演戲。就憑一路過來在路邊看見的那些礦工？戰戰兢兢的，恐怕精彩程度還遠遠不如騎士競技。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殷勤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"騎士競技每年都有，每年都看。但在布列潔諾伊這位女大公的治理之下，十幾年來都不曾判處一樁死刑！我們這次來算是見識到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑剔的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"死刑？什麼人物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殷勤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"一對密謀號召感染者罷工的礦工，在行動時被當場逮到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑剔的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，這還真是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殷勤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，這件事真的很嚴重，聽說女大公簽署死刑命令的時候還落淚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殷勤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，這裡對感染者沒有執行人道死刑的先例。完全可以走兩步路就把他們直接埋進沼澤裡，但這樣不就白白辜負了這少有的死刑判決嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殷勤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我們就在這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殷勤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"按照流程，首先登場的是鞭刑，據說還能讓我們這些買了門票的嘉賓來選鞭子的款式，比方說有沒有刀片、沾不沾鹽水……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"挑剔的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_175","isRemote":false,"text":"萬一沒有控制好力度，他們突然死了，身上的石頭炸在我們面前怎麼辦？我的裙子是為這趟旅程特別新做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殷勤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"絕對不會！他們的感染程度還沒有那麼嚴重，如果不惹事，其實離病死還有好幾年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殷勤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你剛才說的宴會、野餐之類的，該有的都會有的。總之等一下就能看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"殷勤的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，讓我們先去火堆那邊暖暖身體吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐煩的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有呼吸嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"執勤衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女的、女的還在說一些大逆不道的話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐煩的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"男的已經死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"執勤衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天就把舌頭割掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐煩的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不一起割掉她的舌頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"執勤衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天那群客人沒、沒說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"執勤衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們想聽她尖叫——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐煩的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她叫了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"執勤衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒有！連一聲都沒有，一直反覆強調那些“訴求”，說是“為了礦區裡死掉的其他孩子”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"執勤衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一句都聽不懂！她肯定是瘋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐煩的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒發瘋的話，也不會想著讓所有人罷工了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐煩的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，把那個女人的舌頭也割掉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"執勤衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐煩的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個小孩，昨天她好像也站在那裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"執勤衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對。治安官讓她一直站在那裡看，直到她的父母斷氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐煩的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就等她的父母斷氣後，把她送回礦工宿舍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"執勤衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她出生在礦井裡，那她就是礦工。等她爸媽都斷氣了，她還是要拿著她媽媽的礦燈和編號繼續下礦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐煩的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……她手上拿燈了嗎？你看到她手上拿著礦燈了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"執勤衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不耐煩的衛兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就*烏薩斯粗口*處理完送她回宿舍！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別喬克……孩子，你拿著。你拿著這些。奶油、肉醬、巧克力……對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別、別誤會！我的家人絕對沒有出賣你爸媽！這是我去礦井工作、推車，靠自己賺的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後你家就只有你和你奶奶了，你要好好照顧她，知道了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她剛剛跟我借了把剪刀，也不用還給我了。有什麼困難，就來找我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要能幫上忙的，我都會幫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。要是我的孩子還活著，應該跟你差不多大吧。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她後來還說了什麼，我沒有回答。\n是因為我當時沒辦法說話，還是因為我已經走開，回到了家裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"總之，後來我看到紅色——\n紅色流淌在白得發灰的塑膠上。\n我以為我回到了外面，回到了那片空地上……但，不，不是。\n是奶奶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊……"},{"type":"narration","text":"經過昨天，還有今天，我知道人身體裡的紅色並不是無窮無盡的。它會流乾，它會讓人痛苦，它會帶來死亡。\n於是我試圖用手把那些流向四周的紅色留住，像小時候和朋友玩過的那個遊戲。\n“看啊，誰捧起的流水最多，誰就擁有了最多的幸福。”\n“誰用袋子網住的狂風最多，誰就擁有了最多的自由。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚、嗚——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不——不、不！"},{"type":"narration","text":"我留不住。\n我應該留住。\n我留不——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶。"},{"type":"narration","text":"失溫的身體在我眼前陷進塑膠裡，陷進泥土中。我抬起頭。我看到“它”。\n一個蒼白的、站立的虛影。\n我喊道——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“娜迦奶奶？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i10_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……您曾經讓我，忍耐，和，原諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為了活著，是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我們現在，還要……忍耐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在……忍耐，並分擔，其他的痛苦，只會死，也只有死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"難道忍耐，其實只為……一無所有嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"渴望擁有任何事物，會滋生的只是罪孽。你那受苦的靈魂，此刻更需要永恆的安寧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，來我懷裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……難道，您也原諒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我原諒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要接受烏薩斯賜予的生，一如接受烏薩斯賜予的死。不做選擇，不做掙扎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"害死媽媽，害死爸爸……害死你親生的，孩子。你原諒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我原諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“我原諒”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……不……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就……不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不是，娜迦奶奶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶不會這樣，原諒。不會為了，得到平靜，而原諒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她不原諒，她不忍耐。她死了，埋進……泥土裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不是她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i10_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i10_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜迦？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i10_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"■■，不順從■■……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"便……■■毀滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"■■。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別喬克，退後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"女士，她不是！她不是，娜迦奶奶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，它不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……但如果，她不是，奶奶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那她又是誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mantra周身浮動著源石技藝的特殊光芒，在她的助力下，敵人顯露真容。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i21"},{"type":"narration","text":"但事情還沒有結束。她必須進一步建造基於意識空間的屏障，以將自身與眼前的存在，和周圍的普通人隔絕開來。\n在完成之前，她繼續傳達真相。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i21"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“聖愚”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它就是你問過的聖愚，是有著這個名稱的邪魔造物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它也許曾經是人類，但如今已和這個概念相去甚遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不懂……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不必懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"即使我曾有萬分之一的可能成為它，我也從未弄清它的本質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而你只是在錯誤的時間看到了它、呼喚了它，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"錯誤的時間？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以……從一開始，就是錯的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"■■■，■■……■■。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這不是你的錯，別喬克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"從現在起，這裡由我接手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
